@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Use Case Diagram — Phase 1 (Part 2)\nExamination, Billing, Catalog, Report

top to bottom direction

actor Admin #DBEAFE
actor Doctor #DCFCE7
actor Cashier #FFEDD5
actor Manager #F3E8FF

rectangle "4N Clinic — Examination, Billing & Catalog" {

  package "Examination & Prescription" {
    usecase "UC09\nRecord examination" as UC09
    usecase "UC10\nDiagnose disease" as UC10
    usecase "UC11\nPrescribe drugs" as UC11
    usecase "UC12\nView medical history" as UC12
    usecase "UC13\nComplete examination" as UC13
  }

  package "Billing" {
    usecase "UC14\nCreate invoice" as UC14
    usecase "UC15\nRecord payment" as UC15
    usecase "UC16\nSearch invoices" as UC16
  }

  package "Catalog & Configuration" {
    usecase "UC17\nManage regulations" as UC17
    usecase "UC18\nManage disease catalog" as UC18
    usecase "UC19\nManage drug catalog" as UC19
  }

  package "Report" {
    usecase "UC20\nView monthly report" as UC20
  }
}

Doctor --> UC09
Doctor --> UC10
Doctor --> UC11
Doctor --> UC12
Doctor --> UC13

Cashier --> UC14
Cashier --> UC15
Cashier --> UC16

Admin --> UC17
Admin --> UC18
Admin --> UC19

Manager --> UC20
Manager --> UC16

UC10 .> UC09 : <<include>>
UC11 .> UC09 : <<extend>>
UC13 .> UC09 : requires saved exam
UC14 .> UC13 : requires completed visit
UC15 .> UC14 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC14
UC14 requires the examination
to be in DONE status.
Invoice total = consultation fee
+ drug items from prescription.
end note

@enduml
